            "document_id": "sample-Worksheet-1-Purity-and-Recursion",
            "filename": "Worksheet-1-Purity-and-Recursion.pdf",
            "page": 2,
            "quote": "safeHead [] = Nothing safeHead (x:_) = Just x The result is Maybe a. safeHead [] returns Nothing; safeHead [9,8] returns Just 9. The caller must handle the Nothing case."
          },
