            "filename": "Lecture-2-Recursion-and-Lists.pdf",
            "page": 2,
            "quote": "The built-in head is partial: head [] has no valid element to return and raises an error. A safer interface returns Maybe, such as safeHead [] = Nothing and safeHead (x:_) = Just x. Maybe makes the empty case explicit in the result type."
